    skos:prefLabel "22 Application provision—item 18"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-22-2 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by item 18 of this Schedule does not apply to a record, or a part of a record, if:  (a) the record is in the open access period; and  (b) one of the following applies:  (i) in relation to the record—a certificate issued under section 34 of the Archives Act 1983 (as in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule) is in force in respect of the record;  (ii) in relation to the part of the record—the part of the record is identified in accordance with subsection 34(2) of that Act (as in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule) in a certificate issued under section 34 of that Act (as in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule). Note: A certificate ceases to be in force if it is revoked by force of subitem 20(2).  Administrative Appeals Tribunal Act 1975  Schedule 3  Freedom of Information (Removal of Conclusive Certificates and Other Measures) Act 2009 No. 99, 2009            23" ;
    skos:definition "The amendment made by item 18 of this Schedule does not apply to a record, or a part of a record, if:  (a) the record is in the open access period; and  (b) one of the following applies:  (i) in relation to the record—a certificate issued under section 34 of the Archives Act 1983 (as in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule) is in force in respect of the record;  (ii) in relation to the part of the record—the part of the record is identified in accordance with subsection 34(2) of that Act (as in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule) in a certificate issued under section 34 of that Act (as in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule). Note: A certificate ceases to be in force if it is revoked by force of subitem 20(2).  Administrative Appeals Tribunal Act 1975  Schedule 3  Freedom of Information (Removal of Conclusive Certificates and Other Measures) Act 2009 No. 99, 2009            23"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "78298c20f936abe9f1fc7be8912e70bae191a7e1ae0d3fe00276eee84600c54b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemption from application of amendment for records in open access period or with certificate issued under Archives Act 1983" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
