concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2009-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2009(10) No. 99, 2009"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2009-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) If, before the proceeding has been completed, one of the members constituting the Division for the purposes of the proceeding has ceased to be available for the purposes of the proceeding the proceeding is to be reheard by the Division as reconstituted in accordance with this section. Regard may be had to record of previous proceeding" ;
    skos:definition "(10) If, before the proceeding has been completed, one of the members constituting the Division for the purposes of the proceeding has ceased to be available for the purposes of the proceeding the proceeding is to be reheard by the Division as reconstituted in accordance with this section. Regard may be had to record of previous proceeding"@en ;
