concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2009-ss-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2009(11) No. 99, 2009"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2009-ss-11 ;
    values:originalText "(11) If the Division:  (a) is reconstituted in accordance with a direction under subsection (6); or  (b) is reconstituted because proceedings are remitted under paragraph (7)(b) to the Division as previously constituted; or  (c) is reconstituted under subsection (10) because a member ceases to be available; the members of the Division may have regard to any record of the proceeding in the Division as previously constituted, including a record of any evidence taken in the proceeding.  Schedule 4  Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986" ;
    skos:definition "(11) If the Division:  (a) is reconstituted in accordance with a direction under subsection (6); or  (b) is reconstituted because proceedings are remitted under paragraph (7)(b) to the Division as previously constituted; or  (c) is reconstituted under subsection (10) because a member ceases to be available; the members of the Division may have regard to any record of the proceeding in the Division as previously constituted, including a record of any evidence taken in the proceeding.  Schedule 4  Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "af14c849b074607d355a32a2014bb255caaca4762ae5c1bd9580722aeddce2a5" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2009 ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consider a record of proceedings in the Division as previously constituted when reconstituting." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
